<title>USA: Wall St stocks higher at open.</title>
<headline>Wall St stocks higher at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened higher with bonds in early trading on Friday after fourth quarter GDP data indicated lower inflation than had been expected.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials rose six to 6,830 at the start. The Nasdaq Composite was up four at 1,375, while the S&amp;P Index rose one to 785</p>
<p>The 30-year long bond was up 10/32 to yield 6.85 percent.</p>
</text>
